      "title": "Oscillations and Electric Fields",
      "gist": "Brain waves actively shape spiking, and through electric fields they can influence many neurons at once and almost instantly, making them good candidates for rapid control.",
      "question": "Ephaptic coupling — how can brain waves directly shape which neurons spike?"
    },
